{"h":3166,"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.59386973048917502,"h":0.017687934301958252,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","w":0.31226053873697923,"y":0.042008843930979811,"c":1},{"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 2","w":0.35057472229003905,"h":0.023401804988473107,"x":0.088122600265176723,"y":0.091569767446150863,"c":1},{"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","c":1,"y":0.12936046504247256,"x":0.088122602230117059,"w":0.19731801350911457,"h":0.015988372205106516},{"w":0.68019536336263031,"h":0.018512311346231214,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.5 score:","y":0.1671235071714553,"x":0.086148456899677039},{"h":0.020530638029058745,"x":0.088122609765688364,"t":"Most contemporary economies allow such a model of employment as being self-employed, which","y":0.19614655736060604,"w":0.78735631306966147,"c":1},{"x":0.086132240427862994,"t":"appears very tempting for many. However, still the vast majority of people opt for being employed in","c":1,"w":0.81432271321614569,"y":0.21722008512025692,"h":0.022523449857402178},{"x":0.086206895296318087,"y":0.23973468098246042,"t":"a company and not to set up their own business. This essay will attempt to look into the key factors","h":0.020530638029058745,"c":1,"w":0.81226053873697923},{"y":0.26152874301539786,"w":0.60153254191080729,"h":0.018994512696546284,"c":1,"t":"as to why people may prefer entrepreneurship and major drawbacks to it.","x":0.086206909019851799},{"x":0.086102548320956387,"h":0.023039552130732277,"y":0.28940137530403431,"c":1,"w":0.8047799173990885,"t":"To start with, in many modern societies, including Russian, entrepreneurship is greatly encouraged"},{"t":"with lots of business seminars and workshops advertised. These may range from slightly fraudulent","y":0.31238155448518734,"h":0.020530638029058856,"w":0.80842910766601561,"x":0.086206902008232,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.084291191913576327,"t":"to genuinely educational and supportive, and generally any information on setting up a company","y":0.33284883767868734,"w":0.78735631306966136,"h":0.020348836256594782},{"y":0.35425727246362904,"w":0.7989666239420572,"h":0.021802214226689598,"t":"is easily accessible for those who are willing. And willing they are, as being a business person, the","c":1,"x":0.084228801579405779},{"h":0.020348836256594782,"w":0.80459767659505199,"y":0.37645348884540064,"t":"image itselt has a certain teel of luxury, respectability and success. People are being told that they","c":1,"x":0.086206908732551712},{"w":0.649425303141276,"t":"have no limits and can easily become as wealthy as a Steve Jobs is they wish it.","x":0.086206888338281829,"y":0.39671509767333424,"h":0.020530638029058745,"c":1},{"h":0.02281172819252042,"c":1,"x":0.086091835976476239,"y":0.42655235055139462,"t":"This first reason is linked to the second, which is relevant for Russia and some other counties.","w":0.77607681274414064},{"y":0.44912790744983699,"h":0.020348836256594782,"w":0.77969350179036456,"c":1,"t":"Bank loans are accessible too, and they are largely eagerly granted. If a future business person","x":0.086206888827838196},{"t":"truly knows their business, it poses no threat. Nevertheless, easy access to setting up a company for","x":0.086206888574745899,"w":0.81609196980794274,"c":1,"h":0.018962376342117948,"y":0.47093023265362399},{"h":0.021695900324847361,"c":1,"y":0.49047899698981423,"t":"someone inexperienced or insensible may cause a range of problems.","x":0.086102125417652456,"w":0.567271982828776},{"h":0.01895135818066962,"c":1,"w":0.80459767659505199,"y":0.52179406190530331,"t":"Apparently, the first issue that may perplex an unskilled entrepreneur is the necessity to be a jack","x":0.086206908724372033},{"w":0.80459767659505221,"t":"of all trades (if the company is very small). Having taken the responsibilities of an accountant, PR","x":0.086206908710264069,"y":0.54200884348772327,"h":0.020530638029058745,"c":1},{"h":0.020530638029058745,"c":1,"t":"or HR manager at the same time can be a burden and make the person wish they had never done","x":0.086206908722302078,"w":0.8045976765950521,"y":0.56380290590006776},{"y":0.58575581442697611,"x":0.086206885935334016,"t":"it at all. If they hire other people to perform these tasks, they must pay more tax and provide their","w":0.81034484863281264,"c":1,"h":0.020371791914303161},{"x":0.086206902013469269,"y":0.60755813963061223,"h":0.01889534864106357,"c":1,"t":"employees with decent working conditions. At the same time, business is usually a risky matter and","w":0.80842910766601572},{"w":0.81417622884114593,"c":1,"y":0.62790697696617936,"x":0.086206911082300525,"h":0.020348836256594671,"t":"in our competitive reality many of them go bankrupt. And last, but not least - self-employed people"},{"x":0.086136145655555274,"w":0.80092188517252605,"c":1,"y":0.64888222362538239,"t":"are the only people responsible for their own vacations, sick or maternity leaves or any job perks.","h":0.022274829433149512},{"x":0.086206900836494169,"h":0.018895348641063681,"w":0.78735631306966147,"t":"So, in a nutshell, being your own master has many downsides, that is why many people decide to","y":0.68023255823519746,"c":1},{"y":0.70124986065372907,"h":0.019011906559378455,"c":1,"x":0.087879104181825221,"t":"play it sate.","w":0.094356733957926445},{"c":1,"x":0.088034805556004112,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.017042633557876941,"y":0.73737482869697035,"w":0.30673467000325522},{"x":0.13405293649072766,"y":0.7744221820251892,"w":0.75680150349934894,"h":0.018811314450888683,"c":1,"t":"The candidate has produced a well-developed response to the task. Further ideas"},{"x":0.13409962933574907,"w":0.76819920857747404,"y":0.79360465125798307,"h":0.01889534864106357,"t":"could be included, e.g. wanting to develop own ideas, wanting to work more flexibly","c":1},{"h":0.01875080221902703,"w":0.76257008870442711,"x":0.13213002706339333,"t":"than employment allows for. There is a clear progression throughout the response,","y":0.81121170431647216,"c":1},{"w":0.76819920857747404,"h":0.017499706222524614,"t":"with information and ideas organised logically. There is a range of cohesive devices","c":1,"x":0.13409962933195269,"y":0.82994186018233551},{"y":0.84870499070439587,"x":0.1321839059049813,"w":0.75478927612304691,"h":0.016120590744934216,"c":1,"t":"[To start with | These | The first ... the second | Apparently | last but not least] and"},{"c":1,"t":"each paragraph has a clear central topic. There is a wide range of vocabulary,","x":0.13409962441685516,"w":0.72030649820963544,"y":0.86627906948198019,"h":0.017485933671325893},{"h":0.017687934301958363,"c":1,"w":0.70114944458007811,"x":0.13026818949213692,"t":"including less common items and showing evidence of style and collocation","y":0.88502842723083652},{"h":0.017687934301958363,"t":"[contemporary | tempting | vast majority | opt for | entrepreneurship | fraudulent |","y":0.90397978500259346,"w":0.73946360270182288,"c":1,"x":0.13218390743284147},{"t":"135","w":0.036398468017578178,"c":1,"x":0.86973180041809461,"y":0.95203488382849311,"h":0.014534883384680453}]}